===============QTI SEPOLICY =================================. 
All vendor related sepolicy (cil) files are going to be added here . 

During the pre-phase of build all this files are copied to upstream 
code in the below path . 
build_dir/target-arm_cortex-a7+neon-vfpv4_musl_eabi/selinux-policy-0.8

Any contribution to this folder please follow the folder tree and naming 
convention of upstream  you can refer to the above path  under /src 
you can see different cil file   place in each directory based on the type of 
resource /bin.


Make file: 
Local reference of Makefile :   package/system/selinux-policy/Makefile
https://git.openwrt.org/?p=openwrt/openwrt.git;a=blob;f=package/system/selinux-policy/Makefile

To compile just sepolicy :
 make -j16  V=sc  package/system/selinux-policy 

For example you can refer 
build_dir/target-arm_cortex-a7+neon-vfpv4_musl_eabi/selinux-policy-0.8/src


Other doc/links :
https://openwrt.org/packages/pkgdata/selinux-policy

